# public/_headers
# Response Headers for Cloudflare Pages
#
# Author: Edward Silva
# Creation Date: 10 November, 2026
# Last Update: 10 November, 2026
#
# Keeps the edwardasilva.pages.dev production hostname out of search indexes. Cloudflare adds noindex
# to preview aliases such as dev.edwardasilva.pages.dev by itself, but never to the project hostname.
# The hostname stays reachable on purpose, and the dev site stays untouched.
#
# File Structure:
# - One host-scoped rule: the URL pattern, then its indented headers
#
# Where this file is used within the repository:
# - Astro copies public/ into dist/, and Cloudflare Pages reads dist/_headers on deploy
# - Not applied by astro dev or astro preview
#
# Usage:
# $ `curl -D - https://edwardasilva.pages.dev/` : Shows x-robots-tag: noindex
#
# Copyright (c) 2026 Edward Silva. All rights reserved.

https://edwardasilva.pages.dev/*
  X-Robots-Tag: noindex
